{
  "n01": {
    "baselineRevision": 5,
    "readingFlow": [
      {
        "id": "heading-factors",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "式を掛け算に戻す"
      },
      {
        "id": "marker-factor-example",
        "type": "marker",
        "kind": "example",
        "text": "例題"
      },
      {
        "id": "paragraph-intro",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "次の三つの式を比べよう。"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "-2x,\\quad x^2,\\quad -x^2y^2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "。どれも数と文字の掛け算で読める。例えば "
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "x^2=x\\times x"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " である。マイナスがあるときは、符号も数の部分に含めて考える。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-bridge-explain-n01-01-before",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まず−x²y²を「数×文字×文字…」の形に戻します。前の負号を数の部分に含め、xとyがそれぞれ何回掛かっているか見えるようにします。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "formula-n01-01",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "-x^2y^2="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\times x\\times x\\times y\\times y"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paragraph-concept-monomial",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "このように数と文字の積で表した式を"
          },
          {
            "type": "term",
            "text": "単項式"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "という。ここでは文字の指数を0以上の整数として扱う。数の部分を"
          },
          {
            "type": "term",
            "text": "係数"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "、掛け合わせた文字の総数を"
          },
          {
            "type": "term",
            "text": "次数"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "という。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-bridge-explain-n01-01-after",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "先頭の数は係数を読むため、後ろに並ぶ文字は次数を数えるために使える。同じ分解から二種類の情報を取り出す。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-coefficient-intro",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "係数と次数を、一つずつ確かめます。まず数の部分を読み取り、次に掛け合わせた文字の個数を数えます。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-negative-heading",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "−2xの係数と次数"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-negative-lead",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "−2xを掛け算に戻すと、−2×xです。符号を含む数の部分が係数です。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-negative-coefficient-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "-2x=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-bridge-r3-negative-coefficient"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")\\times x"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-negative-degree-lead",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "次に次数を見ます。掛けている文字はxが一つなので、その個数を入れます。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-negative-degree-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{次数}="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-bridge-r3-negative-degree"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-square-heading",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "x²の係数と次数"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-square-lead",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "x²は、xを二つ掛けた式です。文字の前に数がない場合は、1が省略されています。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-square-coefficient-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "x^2="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-bridge-r3-square-coefficient"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\times x\\times x"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-square-degree-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{次数}="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-bridge-r3-square-degree"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-product-heading",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "−x²y²の係数と次数"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-product-lead",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "最初に扱った−x²y²も、同じ順に読みます。前の負号を数の部分に含めて、係数を入れます。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-product-coefficient-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "-x^2y^2=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-bridge-r3-product-coefficient"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")\\times x\\times x\\times y\\times y"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-product-degree-lead",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "次数は、xとyを合わせて数えます。xが二つ、yが二つなので、2+2を計算します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-r3-product-degree-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{次数}=2+2="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-bridge-r3-product-degree"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "heading-variable",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "どの文字を見るか"
      },
      {
        "id": "marker-variable-example",
        "type": "marker",
        "kind": "example",
        "text": "例題"
      },
      {
        "id": "paragraph-variable-intro",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "同じ式 "
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "5x^3y"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " でも、注目する文字によって見方が変わる。"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "x"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " に注目するとき、"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "y"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " は変わらない数とみなす。"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そこで、"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "x^3"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " の前に掛かるものを一つにまとめよう。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-bridge-explain-n01-03-before",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "この問題ではxだけが変化すると考える。yを消すのではなく、数5と一緒に係数側へ移して、x³に何が掛かるかを見える形にする。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "formula-n01-03",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "5x^3y="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\,x^3"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-bridge-explain-n01-03-after",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "掛け算の順を入れ替えただけなので式の値は変わらない。注目する文字をyへ変えるときも、同じ方法でyの外側に残るものを集める。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-y-goal",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "同じ5x³yを、今度はyについて読みます。yを一つ残し、それ以外を係数の側にまとめます。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-y-reorder",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "5x^3y=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-s4-y-coefficient"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")y^1"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-y-coefficient-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{yの係数}=5x^3"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-y-degree-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{yについての次数}="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-s4-y-degree"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-y-result",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "yについて見ると係数は5x³、次数は1です。xについて見たときと、残す文字が変わっています。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-2"
      },
      {
        "id": "marker-variable-check",
        "type": "marker",
        "kind": "check",
        "text": "確認"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-axy-goal",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "次はaxyに同じ方法を使います。まずxに注目します。掛け算の順序を変え、xだけを右に残します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-3"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-axy-x-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "axy=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-s4-axy-x"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")x"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-3"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-axy-switch",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "xの係数はayでした。今度はyだけを右に残し、同じ式を読み直します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-3"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-axy-y-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "axy=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-s4-axy-y"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")y"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-3"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-axy-conclusion",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "元の式は変わりません。注目する文字を変えると、その文字に掛かる係数の見方が変わります。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-3"
      },
      {
        "id": "heading-like-terms",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "同類項をまとめる：問題と見通し"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-goal",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "3x²−5x+6−5x²+2x−3を簡単にします。二次の項、一次の項、定数項の順に、一組ずつ計算してから全体を組み立てます。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-4"
      },
      {
        "id": "formula-like-original",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "3x^2-5x+6-5x^2+2x-3"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-4"
      },
      {
        "id": "paragraph-term-concept",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "引き算は負の数を足すこととして読めます。符号を含む一つ一つのまとまりを項、単項式の和を多項式といいます。文字の部分が同じ項が同類項です。項を取り出すときも前の符号を一緒に扱います。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-4"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-square",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "① 二次の項をまとめる"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-square-target",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "文字の部分がx²の項を、元の式から符号ごと取り出します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-5"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4-local-n01-06a",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{二次の項：}"
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-06a"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-5"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-square-reason",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "二つの項は同じx²の何倍かを表します。係数を引き、文字の部分x²を残します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-5"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-square-factor",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "3x^2-5x^2=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-s5-square-regroup"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")x^2"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-5"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4-local-n01-r3-q07-x2coef",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "(3-5)x^2=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-r3-q07-x2coef"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")x^2"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-5"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-square-result",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{二次の項：}-2x^2"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-5"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-linear",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "② 一次の項をまとめる"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-linear-target",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "文字の部分がxの項は−5xと+2xです。同じxを残し、係数−5と+2を足します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-6"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-linear-factor",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "-5x+2x=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-s5-linear-regroup"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")x"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-6"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4-local-n01-r3-q07-xcoef",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "(-5+2)x=("
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-r3-q07-xcoef"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": ")x"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-6"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-linear-result",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{一次の項：}-3x"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-6"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-constant",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "③ 定数項をまとめる"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-constant-target",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "文字を含まない項は+6と−3です。この二つを計算します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-7"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4-local-n01-r3-q07-const",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "6-3="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n01-r3-q07-const"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-7"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-constant-result",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "\\text{定数項：}3"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-7"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-assembly",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "④ 結果を戻し、式を読む"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-assembly-text",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "二次の項−2x²、一次の項−3x、定数項3が求まりました。これらを次数の高い順に並べます。異なる次数の項は、これ以上まとめません。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-8"
      },
      {
        "id": "formula-n01-07",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "3x^2-5x+6-5x^2+2x-3=-2x^2-3x+3"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n01-s5-stage-8"
      },
      {
        "id": "n01-s4-like-degree-text",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
