        "derivationId": "n06-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n06-s4-first-goal",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "(x+2y+1)(x+2y−2)−4を因数分解します。繰り返す部分にXという名前を付け、Xの二次式として因数分解してから、最後にxとyへ戻します。"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n06-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n06-lead-01",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "二つの括弧に繰り返し現れる式のまとまりを見つけ、それをXと置いてみよう。"
          },
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "(x+2y+1)(x+2y-2)-4"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n06-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n06-s4-substitution-part-formula",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "X="
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "itemId": "n06-s4-substitution-part"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n06-s5-stage-1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n06-formula-01",
        "type": "formula",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "math",
            "latex": "X=x+2y"
          }
        ],
        "derivationId": "n06-s5-stage-1"
      },
